  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"table-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><br></div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"971\"><strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"971\">Premium Concave Feather Flags</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1300\">Make your brand stand out from every angle with our <strong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1058\">Premium Concave Feather Flags</strong>, designed for high visibility at outdoor events, trade shows, storefronts, and festivals. Featuring a sleek feather-style silhouette, these flags deliver strong visual impact and professional branding in both indoor and outdoor environments.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1488\">All flags are <strong data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1343\">double-sided by default</strong>, ensuring maximum exposure, and are printed using <strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1424\">full-color dye sublimation</strong> on premium poly knit fabric for vibrant, long-lasting graphics.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1515\"><strong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1515\">Key Features</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"2538\">\ud83c\udf8f <strong data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1546\">Concave Feather Shape:</strong> Eye-catching feather-style design that moves naturally in the wind.<br data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1617\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1655\">Double-Sided Printing Included:</strong> Graphics are visible from both sides at no extra cost.<br data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1713\">\ud83d\udccf <strong data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1736\">Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from <strong data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1771\">9ft, 12ft, or 15ft</strong> to match your visibility needs.<br data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1806\">\ud83d\udda8\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1841\">Full-Color Dye Sublimation:</strong> Artwork printed on white super poly knit fabric for rich, fade-resistant color.<br data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1924\">\ud83e\uddf5 <strong data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1960\">Reinforced Edge Construction:</strong> Fiberglass pole pockets create a clean black outline along the flag edge.<br data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2037\">\ud83d\udcaa <strong data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2070\">Flexible Fiberglass Poles:</strong> Strong, durable, and wind-resistant construction.<br data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2123\">\u2699\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2156\">Ergonomic Aluminum Collar:</strong> Polished aluminum pole segments for smooth assembly and stability.<br data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2226\">\ud83e\udea8 <strong data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2265\">Cross Base + Water Bag Included:</strong> Ideal for hard, flat surfaces both indoors and outdoors.<br data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2325\">\ud83d\udd29 <strong data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2358\">Multiple Mounting Options:</strong> Upgrade to <strong data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2387\">ground stakes</strong> or a <strong data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2416\">canopy mounting kit</strong> to attach flags directly to a canopy tent.<br data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2462\">\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2488\">Wind Speed Rating:</strong> Designed to perform in winds up to <strong data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2537\">18\u201323 mph</strong>.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2562\"><strong data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2562\">Materials</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2692\">\ud83c\udf92 <strong data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2582\">Carry Case:</strong> 600 Denier Polyester<br data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2606\">\ud83e\uddf5 <strong data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2626\">Flag Graphic:</strong> 110g Knitted Polyester<br data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2652\">\ud83d\udd29 <strong data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2668\">Hardware:</strong> 100% Epoxy Fiberglass</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2720\"><strong data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2720\">Primary Usage</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2854\">Outdoor advertising, trade shows, festivals, storefronts, farmers markets, brand activations, sports events, and canopy tent setups.</p>\n<h2>\n<strong>Warranty</strong><br>\n</h2>\n<p>We stand behind the quality of our products. Our warranty covers any factory defects or damage that occurs during shipping. However, please note that we do not cover damage resulting from extreme weather conditions, misuse, or any circumstances beyond our control.</p>",
  "descriptionText": "Premium Concave Feather Flags\nMake your brand stand out from every angle with our Premium Concave Feather Flags, designed for high visibility at outdoor events, trade shows, storefronts, and festivals. Featuring a sleek feather-style silhouette, these flags deliver strong visual impact and professional branding in both indoor and outdoor environments.\nAll flags are double-sided by default, ensuring maximum exposure, and are printed using full-color dye sublimation on premium poly knit fabric for vibrant, long-lasting graphics.\nKey Features\n\ud83c\udf8f Concave Feather Shape: Eye-catching feather-style design that moves naturally in the wind.\n\ud83c\udfa8 Double-Sided Printing Included: Graphics are visible from both sides at no extra cost.\n\ud83d\udccf Available Sizes: Choose from 9ft, 12ft, or 15ft to match your visibility needs.\n\ud83d\udda8\ufe0f Full-Color Dye Sublimation: Artwork printed on white super poly knit fabric for rich, fade-resistant color.\n\ud83e\uddf5 Reinforced Edge Construction: Fiberglass pole pockets create a clean black outline along the flag edge.\n\ud83d\udcaa Flexible Fiberglass Poles: Strong, durable, and wind-resistant construction.\n\u2699\ufe0f Ergonomic Aluminum Collar: Polished aluminum pole segments for smooth assembly and stability.\n\ud83e\udea8 Cross Base + Water Bag Included: Ideal for hard, flat surfaces both indoors and outdoors.\n\ud83d\udd29 Multiple Mounting Options: Upgrade to ground stakes or a canopy mounting kit to attach flags directly to a canopy tent.\n\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f Wind Speed Rating: Designed to perform in winds up to 18\u201323 mph.\nMaterials\n\ud83c\udf92 Carry Case: 600 Denier Polyester\n\ud83e\uddf5 Flag Graphic: 110g Knitted Polyester\n\ud83d\udd29 Hardware: 100% Epoxy Fiberglass\nPrimary Usage\nOutdoor advertising, trade shows, festivals, storefronts, farmers markets, brand activations, sports events, and canopy tent setups.\nWarranty\nWe stand behind the quality of our products. Our warranty covers any factory defects or damage that occurs during shipping. However, please note that we do not cover damage resulting from extreme weather conditions, misuse, or any circumstances beyond our control.",
